# A simple asynchronous clicker game.
# No loops. No variables. Just physical state and flow.

make a neuron named score with threshold 5 and leak 0
make a neuron named reward with threshold 1 and leak 0

# Every time the player clicks, the score neuron accumulates it
put player_click into the input of score

# When the score reaches the threshold (5 clicks), it spikes and triggers a reward
flow the spike from score into the input of reward

start the system
